1
00:00:11,800 --> 00:00:13,000
What's wrong, Yayan?

2
00:00:19,040 --> 00:00:19,800
Nothing.

3
00:00:20,800 --> 00:00:21,640
Drive.

4
00:00:46,600 --> 00:00:47,680
Is there something going on

5
00:00:47,680 --> 00:00:49,280
between you and Song Yanfei?

6
00:00:51,440 --> 00:00:51,970
There is.

7
00:00:53,800 --> 00:00:55,400
But it's strictly business.

8
00:00:55,560 --> 00:00:56,240
Right?

9
00:00:56,840 --> 00:00:57,700
Just business.

10
00:00:59,080 --> 00:00:59,940
What business?

11
00:01:00,920 --> 00:01:01,720
Bai Xiaosi.

12
00:01:02,480 --> 00:01:03,720
I've finished investigating

13
00:01:03,720 --> 00:01:04,800
Bai Xiaosi.

14
00:01:05,160 --> 00:01:06,960
He has a solid alibi.

15
00:01:07,480 --> 00:01:08,560
That night,

16
00:01:08,640 --> 00:01:10,800
his girlfriend and four or five
of her friends were there

17
00:01:10,800 --> 00:01:11,730
to vouch for him.

18
00:01:12,640 --> 00:01:13,360
However,

19
00:01:13,560 --> 00:01:15,480
impersonating a public servant

20
00:01:15,480 --> 00:01:16,480
is illegal.

21
00:01:16,480 --> 00:01:18,720
He's been handed over to the public
security department for punishment.

22
00:01:18,720 --> 00:01:20,320
Why are there so many

23
00:01:20,320 --> 00:01:21,840
fake traffic cops lately?

24
00:01:27,280 --> 00:01:28,200
What are you doing?

25
00:01:28,200 --> 00:01:29,600
Going to Shen Xi's place.

26
00:01:41,720 --> 00:01:42,800
This way.

27
00:01:51,920 --> 00:01:52,800
Officers,

28
00:01:53,360 --> 00:01:54,560
what brings you here?

29
00:01:55,000 --> 00:01:57,680
Are you heading out, Ms. Shen?

30
00:01:58,920 --> 00:02:01,780
I was just about to practice
dancing on the rooftop.

31
00:02:02,040 --> 00:02:02,900
Please come in.

32
00:02:07,280 --> 00:02:08,919
Do we need to take off our shoes?

33
00:02:08,919 --> 00:02:10,400
No, it's fine.

34
00:02:14,400 --> 00:02:15,460
Please have a seat.

35
00:02:19,960 --> 00:02:21,600
What brings

36
00:02:21,760 --> 00:02:23,079
you three here?

37
00:02:25,640 --> 00:02:26,920
Taoli Cup.

38
00:02:27,360 --> 00:02:28,320
Captain Li,

39
00:02:28,480 --> 00:02:29,880
you know about the Taoli Cup?

40
00:02:29,880 --> 00:02:30,640
A little.

41
00:02:31,320 --> 00:02:32,120
Ms. Shen,

42
00:02:32,520 --> 00:02:34,050
you're very professional.

43
00:02:34,400 --> 00:02:36,360
Not just anyone can win this award.

44
00:02:36,480 --> 00:02:37,520
I didn't expect

45
00:02:37,680 --> 00:02:39,610
Captain Li to know so much about it.

46
00:02:39,640 --> 00:02:41,320
I thought you cops

47
00:02:41,440 --> 00:02:42,760
only had cases on your minds.

48
00:02:42,760 --> 00:02:43,640
Our Captain Li

49
00:02:43,640 --> 00:02:45,240
used to study art.

50
00:02:45,760 --> 00:02:47,240
A poet and a scholar.

51
00:02:47,880 --> 00:02:49,610
I'm also a democratic fighter.

52
00:02:52,040 --> 00:02:52,720
Ms. Shen,

53
00:02:53,240 --> 00:02:56,170
is it convenient to go
to the rooftop where you dance?

54
00:02:56,720 --> 00:02:57,240
Sure.

55
00:02:57,800 --> 00:02:58,800
This way, please.

56
00:03:11,040 --> 00:03:11,880
Please take a seat.

57
00:03:11,880 --> 00:03:13,040
It's so beautiful.

58
00:03:13,480 --> 00:03:14,080
Thank you.

59
00:03:19,200 --> 00:03:19,960
Please, sit.

60
00:03:21,800 --> 00:03:22,960
Officers,

61
00:03:23,400 --> 00:03:24,640
what brings

62
00:03:24,800 --> 00:03:25,960
you here?

63
00:03:28,400 --> 00:03:29,200
Mr. Shen,

64
00:03:30,120 --> 00:03:32,120
seeing all those trophies downstairs,

65
00:03:32,120 --> 00:03:33,680
we just want to talk about

66
00:03:33,680 --> 00:03:34,520
the competition

67
00:03:34,520 --> 00:03:35,800
you entered last year.

68
00:03:36,320 --> 00:03:37,920
Last year's competition...

69
00:03:42,240 --> 00:03:44,240
You must mean the Peach Blossom Cup.

70
00:03:46,040 --> 00:03:47,570
What's there to talk about?

71
00:03:49,240 --> 00:03:50,520
Miss Shen,

72
00:03:50,520 --> 00:03:53,040
you seem quite dismissive
of this competition.

73
00:03:53,040 --> 00:03:53,880
Captain Li,

74
00:03:54,280 --> 00:03:55,400
Officer Jiang said

75
00:03:55,520 --> 00:03:56,880
you studied art.

76
00:03:57,200 --> 00:03:59,860
Then you must know
the prestige of the Taoli Cup.

77
00:03:59,960 --> 00:04:01,890
How good could some local knockoff

78
00:04:01,960 --> 00:04:03,040
like the Taohua Cup

79
00:04:03,920 --> 00:04:05,160
be?

80
00:04:06,320 --> 00:04:08,200
Then why did you participate
in this competition?

81
00:04:08,200 --> 00:04:09,260
What's the reason?

82
00:04:11,760 --> 00:04:13,160
For the money, of course.

83
00:04:13,640 --> 00:04:15,370
The prize money is pretty high.

84
00:04:15,640 --> 00:04:16,880
Unlike the Taoli Cup,

85
00:04:17,200 --> 00:04:18,660
which is just about honor.

86
00:04:19,600 --> 00:04:21,160
I heard you got an Excellence Award

87
00:04:21,160 --> 00:04:22,440
in the end, right?

88
00:04:22,600 --> 00:04:24,660
It's basically a consolation prize.

89
00:04:25,880 --> 00:04:27,800
That's why I said
this competition is sketchy.

90
00:04:27,800 --> 00:04:28,800
It's all rigged.

91
00:04:29,320 --> 00:04:30,040
You guys didn't see

92
00:04:30,040 --> 00:04:31,240
how the top three

93
00:04:31,600 --> 00:04:32,840
danced.

94
00:04:33,440 --> 00:04:35,100
I couldn't even bear to watch.

95
00:04:36,360 --> 00:04:37,159
Then do you know

96
00:04:37,159 --> 00:04:39,960
this competition was sponsored
by Wending Group?

97
00:04:41,560 --> 00:04:42,360
I know.

98
00:04:43,320 --> 00:04:44,760
Do you know the boss of Wending Group

99
00:04:44,760 --> 00:04:45,560
is Gao Yuhai?

100
00:04:47,680 --> 00:04:48,540
I know that too.

101
00:04:49,240 --> 00:04:50,680
Then why didn't you mention this

102
00:04:50,680 --> 00:04:52,880
at the traffic police station that day?

103
00:04:53,880 --> 00:04:55,120
You didn't ask.

104
00:04:55,280 --> 00:04:56,800
So I didn't say anything.

105
00:04:57,560 --> 00:04:59,290
It was just a traffic accident.

106
00:04:59,560 --> 00:05:02,360
Wouldn't saying it just cause
trouble for myself?

107
00:05:08,160 --> 00:05:08,760
Hey,

108
00:05:09,560 --> 00:05:10,960
it's your turn to step in,

109
00:05:11,280 --> 00:05:14,080
or they'll keep pestering
Shen Xi with questions.

110
00:05:18,000 --> 00:05:18,800
Then...

111
00:05:19,240 --> 00:05:22,240
were you a bit disappointed
about not winning a prize?

112
00:05:23,440 --> 00:05:25,100
Of course I was disappointed.

113
00:05:25,800 --> 00:05:27,400
I didn't get the prize money.

114
00:05:27,560 --> 00:05:29,160
But there's nothing I can do.

115
00:05:29,280 --> 00:05:30,680
I don't have connections

116
00:05:31,120 --> 00:05:32,880
or a powerful backer.

117
00:05:34,120 --> 00:05:35,280
What else can I do?

118
00:05:36,000 --> 00:05:37,130
Just accept my fate.

119
00:05:40,400 --> 00:05:41,530
I need to take a call.

120
00:05:46,400 --> 00:05:46,920
Hello?

121
00:05:47,080 --> 00:05:49,320
Are you Officer Li Xingchen, head of the

122
00:05:49,320 --> 00:05:50,840
Gao Yuhai accident task force?

123
00:05:50,840 --> 00:05:52,120
Speaking. Who's calling?

124
00:05:52,120 --> 00:05:53,050
I need to see you.

125
00:05:53,280 --> 00:05:55,010
I have important information.

126
00:05:55,159 --> 00:05:55,760
Someone

127
00:05:56,240 --> 00:05:57,680
murdered Gao Yuhai.

128
00:06:03,120 --> 00:06:04,000
Ms. Shen,

129
00:06:04,120 --> 00:06:05,360
I'd also like to ask,

130
00:06:05,560 --> 00:06:07,960
how did you cope with that disappointment?

131
00:06:09,480 --> 00:06:10,360
Captain Weng,

132
00:06:10,840 --> 00:06:12,160
stop beating around the bush.

133
00:06:12,160 --> 00:06:13,620
Why not just ask directly?

134
00:06:14,120 --> 00:06:15,000
You're wondering if I

135
00:06:15,000 --> 00:06:16,600
held a grudge against Mr. Gao

136
00:06:16,680 --> 00:06:18,920
for not placing in the dance competition

137
00:06:18,920 --> 00:06:20,560
and took the chance

138
00:06:20,880 --> 00:06:22,280
to get revenge,

139
00:06:22,600 --> 00:06:23,040
right?

140
00:06:25,160 --> 00:06:27,090
That's honestly a bit ridiculous.

141
00:06:27,400 --> 00:06:29,080
Why would I risk a murder charge

142
00:06:29,080 --> 00:06:30,880
over something so trivial?

143
00:06:31,880 --> 00:06:33,080
Let's put it this way.

144
00:06:33,720 --> 00:06:35,360
If it were really worth it,

145
00:06:35,960 --> 00:06:37,560
I'd already be the prime suspect
in a serial murder case

146
00:06:37,560 --> 00:06:39,490
from my years drifting in Beijing.

147
00:06:40,240 --> 00:06:41,400
Showbiz,

148
00:06:41,960 --> 00:06:42,840
you know.

149
00:06:43,840 --> 00:06:45,500
You're quite funny, Ms. Shen.

150
00:06:46,360 --> 00:06:47,120
Thank you.

151
00:06:47,840 --> 00:06:48,370
Ms. Shen,

152
00:06:49,159 --> 00:06:51,000
we have something else to do,
so we'll get going.

153
00:06:51,000 --> 00:06:52,600
We'll come back
if anything comes up, okay?

154
00:06:52,600 --> 00:06:53,440
Okay,

155
00:06:54,360 --> 00:06:55,220
we'll head out.

156
00:06:55,440 --> 00:06:56,040
Thank you.

157
00:06:56,280 --> 00:06:57,560
Thanks for your hard work.

158
00:06:57,560 --> 00:06:58,690
Goodbye. Thank you.

159
00:06:59,360 --> 00:06:59,960
Bye.

160
00:07:29,560 --> 00:07:31,440
I think Shen Xi makes sense.

161
00:07:31,600 --> 00:07:33,200
It's not worth killing someone

162
00:07:33,200 --> 00:07:34,960
over a ranking in a dance competition.

163
00:07:34,960 --> 00:07:35,760
Besides,

164
00:07:35,760 --> 00:07:37,760
even if Gao Yuhai is the mastermind,

165
00:07:37,880 --> 00:07:39,740
they didn't have direct contact.

166
00:07:40,840 --> 00:07:42,300
I just can't figure it out.

167
00:07:43,040 --> 00:07:45,170
I think Dahai's analysis makes sense.

168
00:07:45,280 --> 00:07:45,840
Look,

169
00:07:46,320 --> 00:07:48,240
we caught Shen Xi off guard today.

170
00:07:48,640 --> 00:07:49,600
Her words,

171
00:07:49,920 --> 00:07:51,480
reactions, and micro-expressions

172
00:07:51,480 --> 00:07:52,540
were all flawless.

173
00:07:54,440 --> 00:07:56,040
But she is an acting student.

174
00:07:57,600 --> 00:07:59,460
Then she's too good of an actress.

175
00:08:00,320 --> 00:08:01,320
That's one thing.

176
00:08:02,040 --> 00:08:03,560
Also, when we questioned Li Fang,

177
00:08:03,560 --> 00:08:04,960
didn't he analyze it too?

178
00:08:05,040 --> 00:08:06,900
Shen Xi has absolutely no motive.

179
00:08:07,960 --> 00:08:08,620
Captain Li,

180
00:08:08,640 --> 00:08:10,370
what was that phone call about?

181
00:08:11,720 --> 00:08:13,960
The caller said

182
00:08:14,240 --> 00:08:15,240
his name is Feng Shu,

183
00:08:15,240 --> 00:08:16,120
a man.

184
00:08:16,600 --> 00:08:17,360
He reported

185
00:08:17,520 --> 00:08:19,380
that someone murdered Gao Yuhai.

186
00:08:19,600 --> 00:08:22,000
Now, he wants us to go over
so he can explain.

187
00:08:22,600 --> 00:08:24,360
It's a good thing someone reported it.

188
00:08:24,360 --> 00:08:26,240
A report means he knows the truth.

189
00:08:26,320 --> 00:08:26,720
T-T-This

190
00:08:26,720 --> 00:08:28,180
case is about to be solved.

191
00:08:28,600 --> 00:08:29,460
How old are you?

192
00:08:29,760 --> 00:08:31,600
Twenty-four. Can you be more mature?

193
00:08:31,600 --> 00:08:32,840
We don't even know the situation
with this guy yet.

194
00:08:32,840 --> 00:08:33,799
And you're blindly celebrating.

195
00:08:33,799 --> 00:08:34,679
Celebrating what?

196
00:08:34,679 --> 00:08:36,010
So where is the meeting?

197
00:08:37,559 --> 00:08:38,240
They said

198
00:08:38,640 --> 00:08:42,600
it's called Yongmei Investment.

199
00:08:44,360 --> 00:08:45,360
What investment?

200
00:08:45,400 --> 00:08:46,240
What are you doing?

201
00:08:46,240 --> 00:08:48,440
No, what investment? What investment?

202
00:08:48,560 --> 00:08:49,840
Yongmei Investment. What's wrong?

203
00:08:49,840 --> 00:08:51,240
I know this company.

204
00:08:51,240 --> 00:08:51,880
It's that...

205
00:08:51,880 --> 00:08:53,520
that subsidiary of Wending Group,

206
00:08:53,520 --> 00:08:55,250
specializing in investments.

207
00:08:55,320 --> 00:08:57,180
Then hurry up and drive there. Go!

208
00:09:24,640 --> 00:09:26,700
Three police officers came in total.

209
00:09:27,320 --> 00:09:28,280
It seems

210
00:09:29,360 --> 00:09:31,520
you take Mr. Gao's case

211
00:09:31,880 --> 00:09:33,040
quite seriously.

212
00:09:35,360 --> 00:09:36,040
Well,

213
00:09:36,280 --> 00:09:37,840
let me introduce them.

214
00:09:38,560 --> 00:09:40,520
Our municipal bureau has set up
a special task force.

215
00:09:40,520 --> 00:09:43,120
This is Captain Li Xingchen,

216
00:09:43,120 --> 00:09:44,040
head of the task force.

217
00:09:44,040 --> 00:09:45,560
And this is the vice captain.

218
00:09:45,560 --> 00:09:46,480
Captain Weng Wei,

219
00:09:46,480 --> 00:09:46,880
hello.

220
00:09:47,000 --> 00:09:49,280
I'm team member Jiang Dahai.

221
00:09:50,000 --> 00:09:51,800
Captain Weng is very beautiful.

222
00:09:51,960 --> 00:09:53,840
Female police officers
really have an aura.

223
00:09:53,840 --> 00:09:55,000
Let's get down to business.

224
00:09:55,000 --> 00:09:56,720
Mr. Feng, you just said

225
00:09:56,920 --> 00:09:58,520
someone murdered Gao Yuhai.

226
00:09:59,880 --> 00:10:01,240
Tell us the details.

227
00:10:03,040 --> 00:10:05,240
Although I don't have direct evidence,

228
00:10:05,400 --> 00:10:06,960
my intuition tells me

229
00:10:07,400 --> 00:10:08,720
he definitely did it.

230
00:10:09,160 --> 00:10:11,960
He definitely orchestrated
this car accident on purpose

231
00:10:11,960 --> 00:10:13,240
to kill our chairman.

232
00:10:13,600 --> 00:10:14,660
Who do you suspect?

233
00:10:17,360 --> 00:10:18,890
Gao Yayan's ex-boyfriend,

234
00:10:19,360 --> 00:10:20,120
Song Yanfei.

235
00:10:24,520 --> 00:10:25,880
Do you have any proof

236
00:10:26,080 --> 00:10:27,410
to suspect Song Yanfei?

237
00:10:27,720 --> 00:10:28,520
Captain Weng,

238
00:10:28,640 --> 00:10:29,880
I said it upfront.

239
00:10:30,040 --> 00:10:31,720
I don't have direct proof.

240
00:10:31,880 --> 00:10:32,600
Intuition.

241
00:10:32,800 --> 00:10:34,280
Do you know what intuition is?

242
00:10:34,280 --> 00:10:35,000
Intuition?

243
00:10:36,080 --> 00:10:38,120
Mr. Feng, what you're saying
doesn't make sense.

244
00:10:38,120 --> 00:10:39,400
Even without proof,

245
00:10:39,400 --> 00:10:40,880
you should have some analysis.

246
00:10:40,880 --> 00:10:42,740
What exactly are you suspecting?

247
00:10:43,040 --> 00:10:43,720
Yes,

248
00:10:43,840 --> 00:10:46,000
there is definitely an analysis.

249
00:10:46,400 --> 00:10:46,880
We...

250
00:10:46,880 --> 00:10:48,640
Sorry, let me interrupt.

251
00:10:48,880 --> 00:10:50,120
You just said

252
00:10:51,240 --> 00:10:53,160
Song Yanfei is

253
00:10:53,400 --> 00:10:55,160
Gao Yayan's ex-boyfriend.

254
00:10:55,360 --> 00:10:55,960
Right.

255
00:10:56,400 --> 00:10:57,920
What do you mean by that?

256
00:11:00,960 --> 00:11:01,840
Because

257
00:11:02,640 --> 00:11:04,840
I am Gao Yayan's current boyfriend.

258
00:11:05,920 --> 00:11:07,040
To be exact,

259
00:11:07,240 --> 00:11:09,120
I am her fiancé.

260
00:11:11,360 --> 00:11:12,220
It's like this.

261
00:11:14,080 --> 00:11:16,640
After I had the honor of meeting Mr. Gao,

262
00:11:16,840 --> 00:11:18,440
he appreciated me very much.

263
00:11:18,640 --> 00:11:21,960
He promoted me to be
the general manager of this company,

264
00:11:22,400 --> 00:11:24,060
and introduced his daughter,

265
00:11:24,320 --> 00:11:25,920
Gao Yayan, to me.

266
00:11:27,200 --> 00:11:28,000
When was this?

267
00:11:30,760 --> 00:11:32,560
About seven or eight months ago.

268
00:11:32,880 --> 00:11:34,040
Maybe eight or nine months ago.

269
00:11:34,040 --> 00:11:35,360
Less than a year anyway.

270
00:11:35,360 --> 00:11:37,160
After that, we arranged to meet.

271
00:11:46,280 --> 00:11:46,880
Hello.

272
00:11:47,400 --> 00:11:48,400
Gao Yayan, right?

273
00:11:48,480 --> 00:11:49,080
I'm Feng Shu.

274
00:11:49,080 --> 00:11:50,010
Nice to meet you.

275
00:11:52,760 --> 00:11:54,690
Um, do you want something to drink?

276
00:11:54,840 --> 00:11:56,920
The tea upstairs is really good.

277
00:11:57,680 --> 00:11:58,810
I have my health tea.

278
00:11:59,120 --> 00:12:00,780
My boyfriend brewed it for me.

279
00:12:03,000 --> 00:12:04,760
Then do you want something to eat?

280
00:12:04,760 --> 00:12:06,360
The Western food here is also great,

281
00:12:06,360 --> 00:12:07,920
especially the Beef Wellington.

282
00:12:07,920 --> 00:12:08,840
No need.

283
00:12:08,960 --> 00:12:12,020
My boyfriend is waiting for me
to have hot pot together.

284
00:12:13,120 --> 00:12:14,480
Um, Yayan,

285
00:12:14,920 --> 00:12:17,160
Mr. Gao asked us to meet.

286
00:12:17,320 --> 00:12:18,520
Actually, we've met before.

287
00:12:18,520 --> 00:12:19,840
I don't know if you remember,

288
00:12:19,840 --> 00:12:21,240
but it was at an annual party.

289
00:12:21,240 --> 00:12:22,440
Feng Shu, right?

290
00:12:22,920 --> 00:12:25,280
I think I made myself very clear just now.

291
00:12:25,560 --> 00:12:26,760
I have a boyfriend.

292
00:12:27,440 --> 00:12:28,160
And we've both

293
00:12:28,160 --> 00:12:30,440
completed the task Mr. Gao gave us.

294
00:12:30,560 --> 00:12:31,600
I don't think there's any need

295
00:12:31,600 --> 00:12:33,130
to waste each other's time.

296
00:12:33,360 --> 00:12:34,880
I have things to do, so I'll get going.

297
00:12:34,880 --> 00:12:35,560
Yayan,

298
00:12:36,240 --> 00:12:38,840
I don't think this stops us
from being friends.

299
00:12:39,600 --> 00:12:40,320
It does.

300
00:12:41,240 --> 00:12:42,760
My boyfriend cares about me a lot

301
00:12:42,760 --> 00:12:43,680
and gets jealous easily.

302
00:12:43,680 --> 00:12:45,410
He's the most jealous guy ever.

303
00:12:45,560 --> 00:12:47,960
So enjoy the steak by yourself.

304
00:12:47,960 --> 00:12:48,480
Bye.

305
00:12:53,920 --> 00:12:55,360
That's pretty awkward.

306
00:12:55,520 --> 00:12:56,080
So

307
00:12:56,520 --> 00:12:58,640
the boyfriend Gao Yayan mentioned

308
00:12:58,880 --> 00:13:01,200
is Song Yanfei, the guy you suspect?

309
00:13:02,800 --> 00:13:04,280
Actually, I admit

310
00:13:04,640 --> 00:13:06,440
that Yayan still

311
00:13:06,440 --> 00:13:07,800
doesn't like me that much.

312
00:13:07,800 --> 00:13:09,360
Breaking up with Song Yanfei

313
00:13:09,360 --> 00:13:10,800
and getting together with me

314
00:13:10,800 --> 00:13:13,080
were both forced by her dad, Gao Yuhai.

315
00:13:13,400 --> 00:13:14,800
What about you, Mr. Feng?

316
00:13:15,480 --> 00:13:17,400
Do you truly like Gao Yayan,

317
00:13:17,400 --> 00:13:19,530
or do you just like her family's money?

318
00:13:21,760 --> 00:13:24,280
Are you police officers
always this direct?

319
00:13:24,280 --> 00:13:25,240
It's better to be direct.

320
00:13:25,240 --> 00:13:25,960
Saves trouble.

321
00:13:25,960 --> 00:13:27,490
What do you think, Mr. Feng?

322
00:13:28,560 --> 00:13:29,360
No beating around the bush.

323
00:13:29,360 --> 00:13:30,090
That's good.

324
00:13:31,240 --> 00:13:32,960
Result-wise,

325
00:13:33,560 --> 00:13:34,960
as long as we get married,

326
00:13:35,480 --> 00:13:37,840
I'll definitely treat her well
for the rest of my life.

327
00:13:37,840 --> 00:13:38,400
Right.

328
00:13:38,640 --> 00:13:39,800
Bad men lie for a while,

329
00:13:39,800 --> 00:13:41,330
good men lie for a lifetime.

330
00:13:42,360 --> 00:13:43,240
Officer Jiang,

331
00:13:43,240 --> 00:13:44,480
you look young,

332
00:13:44,480 --> 00:13:46,010
but you have deep insights.

333
00:13:47,840 --> 00:13:49,040
Let's put it this way.

334
00:13:49,040 --> 00:13:52,040
It's a lifetime of companionship
and care anyway.

335
00:13:52,040 --> 00:13:53,600
In terms of the result,

336
00:13:53,680 --> 00:13:55,010
there's no difference.

337
00:13:55,360 --> 00:13:56,560
No difference at all.

338
00:13:56,960 --> 00:14:01,160
She was so determined
the first time you met.

339
00:14:01,160 --> 00:14:03,600
Can you guarantee
she'll break up with Song Yanfei

340
00:14:03,600 --> 00:14:04,840
and be with you?

341
00:14:05,960 --> 00:14:06,960
Here's the thing.

342
00:14:07,280 --> 00:14:09,760
Later, I went to her place again

343
00:14:09,760 --> 00:14:10,960
and had dinner there.

344
00:14:11,480 --> 00:14:12,040
Mr. Gao,

345
00:14:12,600 --> 00:14:14,080
Miss hasn't returned yet.

346
00:14:14,280 --> 00:14:16,200
Should I heat up the food again?

347
00:14:16,440 --> 00:14:17,800
No need. Go do your work.

348
00:14:22,080 --> 00:14:23,410
Let's wait a bit longer.

349
00:14:23,640 --> 00:14:24,970
She should be here soon.

350
00:14:25,160 --> 00:14:25,760
It's fine.

351
00:14:27,800 --> 00:14:29,330
Miss, you're finally back.

352
00:14:29,360 --> 00:14:30,620
Here, give me your bag.

353
00:14:30,880 --> 00:14:33,140
Mr. Gao and the guest are waiting for you.

354
00:14:42,160 --> 00:14:42,960
Why is he here?

355
00:14:44,520 --> 00:14:45,800
Yayan, I...

356
00:14:47,280 --> 00:14:49,280
Feng Shu is my guest.

357
00:14:49,440 --> 00:14:51,320
What, you have a problem with that?

358
00:14:51,320 --> 00:14:52,440
This is your house.

359
00:14:52,800 --> 00:14:54,130
As long as you're happy.

360
00:14:54,800 --> 00:14:55,640
I'm leaving.

361
00:14:56,040 --> 00:14:56,880
Yanyan.

362
00:14:57,440 --> 00:14:58,700
By the way, Feng Shu...

363
00:14:58,960 --> 00:15:00,280
I'll tell you one more time.

364
00:15:00,280 --> 00:15:01,880
It's impossible between us.

365
00:15:01,960 --> 00:15:03,640
I don't like you at all.

366
00:15:04,560 --> 00:15:05,200
Yayan,

367
00:15:05,480 --> 00:15:06,240
don't overthink it.

368
00:15:06,240 --> 00:15:07,400
I didn't mean anything else.

369
00:15:07,400 --> 00:15:08,880
Let me do it. I like it.

370
00:15:11,160 --> 00:15:12,760
He is the son-in-law I chose.

371
00:15:13,760 --> 00:15:15,280
Don't you understand?

372
00:15:15,640 --> 00:15:16,760
If you like him,

373
00:15:17,760 --> 00:15:19,640
go marry him yourself!

374
00:15:19,640 --> 00:15:20,970
Don't drag me into this.

375
00:15:21,320 --> 00:15:22,760
Gao Yayan, you...

376
00:15:22,760 --> 00:15:24,440
Hit me. Beat me to death.

377
00:15:25,120 --> 00:15:26,050
Beat me to death.

378
00:15:27,160 --> 00:15:28,880
You are my biological father.

379
00:15:29,200 --> 00:15:30,520
You gave me this life,

380
00:15:31,000 --> 00:15:33,130
and I'm giving it back to you now. Okay?

381
00:15:37,000 --> 00:15:38,120
Yanyan...

382
00:15:40,520 --> 00:15:42,120
Are you trying to piss me off?

383
00:15:43,640 --> 00:15:45,160
That's exactly what I'm doing.

384
00:15:45,160 --> 00:15:45,800
I'll anger you to death

385
00:15:45,800 --> 00:15:47,000
to avenge my mom.

386
00:15:47,640 --> 00:15:49,280
Where were you

387
00:15:49,760 --> 00:15:51,920
and what were you doing
when my mom gave birth to me?

388
00:15:51,920 --> 00:15:53,960
Where were you

389
00:15:54,400 --> 00:15:57,060
and what were you doing
when she closed her eyes?

390
00:15:58,000 --> 00:16:00,160
You visit her grave every Saturday.

391
00:16:00,960 --> 00:16:02,160
Do you miss her?

392
00:16:02,800 --> 00:16:04,530
You're repenting, aren't you?

393
00:16:05,280 --> 00:16:06,760
And now you have the nerve to talk to me

394
00:16:06,760 --> 00:16:07,760
about finding a son-in-law?

395
00:16:07,760 --> 00:16:09,200
Have you no shame?

396
00:16:13,760 --> 00:16:14,560
Mr. Gao!

397
00:16:15,760 --> 00:16:16,400
Mr. Gao!

398
00:16:16,800 --> 00:16:18,400
Mr. Gao! Mr. Gao!

399
00:16:18,400 --> 00:16:19,120
Nanny!

400
00:16:20,160 --> 00:16:22,090
Quick, put this in Mr. Gao's mouth.

401
00:16:22,240 --> 00:16:23,160
Come on, quick.

402
00:16:29,960 --> 00:16:31,760
Are you feeling better, Mr. Gao?

